   "legend": "點擊方框可跳至計畫全文對應條號。",
   "svg": "<svg class=\"flow-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 980 952\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"居整計畫：收案流程\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>居整計畫：收案流程</title><defs><marker id=\"fl-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path class=\"fl-arrow\" d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\"/></marker><marker id=\"fl-arrow-fail\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path class=\"fl-arrow fl-arrow-f\" d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 64.0 L 490.0 86.0 L 179.3 86.0 L 179.3 101.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 64.0 L 490.0 101.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 64.0 L 490.0 86.0 L 800.7 86.0 L 800.7 101.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 179.3 184.0 L 179.3 206.0 L 334.7 206.0 L 334.7 221.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 166.0 L 490.0 197.0 L 334.7 197.0 L 334.7 221.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 800.7 184.0 L 800.7 206.0 L 334.7 206.0 L 334.7 221.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge fl-edge-fail\" d=\"M 638.3 257.0 L 723.0 266.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow-fail)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"684.2\" y=\"250.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">否</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 334.7 286.0 L 334.7 341.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"340.7\" y=\"314.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是</text><path class=\"fl-edge fl-edge-fail\" d=\"M 638.3 368.0 L 723.0 377.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow-fail)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"684.2\" y=\"361.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 334.7 388.0 L 334.7 419.0 L 451.2 419.0 L 451.2 443.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"392.9\" y=\"414.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">否</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 490.0 L 451.2 527.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 574.0 L 451.2 611.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 658.0 L 451.2 680.0 L 257.0 680.0 L 257.0 695.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge fl-edge-fail\" d=\"M 483.0 722.0 L 567.7 731.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow-fail)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"528.8\" y=\"715.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 257.0 742.0 L 257.0 773.0 L 451.2 773.0 L 451.2 797.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"354.1\" y=\"768.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">否</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 844.0 L 451.2 866.0 L 490.0 866.0 L 490.0 881.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><rect class=\"fl-box fl-start\" x=\"264.0\" y=\"24.0\" width=\"452.0\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"20.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-start\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"48.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">病人有居家醫療照護需求</text><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"108.0\" width=\"296.7\" height=\"76.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"179.3\" y=\"132.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">住院病人</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"179.3\" y=\"150.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">經主治醫師評估，由出院準備服務轉介；接受</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"179.3\" y=\"168.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">轉介機構之醫師得到院評估</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"341.7\" y=\"108.0\" width=\"296.7\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"132.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">非住院病人</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"150.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">由參與計畫之特約醫事服務機構直接評估收案</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"652.3\" y=\"108.0\" width=\"296.7\" height=\"76.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"800.7\" y=\"132.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">他方轉介</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"800.7\" y=\"150.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">病人或家屬申請，或長照管理中心、衛生局（</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"800.7\" y=\"168.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">所、室）、社會局（處）轉介</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"6\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><polygon class=\"fl-box fl-decision\" points=\"43.0,228.0 626.3,228.0 638.3,240.0 638.3,274.0 626.3,286.0 43.0,286.0 31.0,274.0 31.0,240.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"334.7\" y=\"252.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是否符合收案條件？居住於住家（不含照護機構），且經評估有明確醫療需求，因失能（巴氏量表</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"334.7\" y=\"270.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">&lt; 60 分）或疾病特性致外出就醫不便</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"6\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-fail\" x=\"730.0\" y=\"228.0\" width=\"219.0\" height=\"76.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"252.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">不符合收案條件</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"270.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">如僅因照顧者無暇接送，應循一般</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"288.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">程序就醫</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"6\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><polygon class=\"fl-box fl-decision\" points=\"43.0,348.0 626.3,348.0 638.3,360.0 638.3,376.0 626.3,388.0 43.0,388.0 31.0,376.0 31.0,360.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"334.7\" y=\"372.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">已於行動不便病人居家照護、呼吸器依賴患者居家照護或安寧居家療護收案？</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"6\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-fail\" x=\"730.0\" y=\"348.0\" width=\"219.0\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"372.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">應自原照護計畫結案後，始得於本</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"390.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">計畫收案（給付不重複）</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"6\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"450.0\" width=\"685.0\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"474.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">擇一最適照護階段收案：居家醫療／重度居家醫療／安寧療護；另可視需要提供居家中醫醫療服務與居家藥事照護</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"534.0\" width=\"685.0\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"558.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">收案前向病人或其家屬說明用藥整合，請其簽署病人用藥整合同意書（附件5）</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"618.0\" width=\"685.0\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"642.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">訪視人員評估後開立收案申請書（附件4），並擬訂居家醫療照護計畫（照護期間、照護內容、訪視頻率等）</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><polygon class=\"fl-box fl-decision\" points=\"43.0,702.0 471.0,702.0 483.0,714.0 483.0,730.0 471.0,742.0 43.0,742.0 31.0,730.0 31.0,714.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"257.0\" y=\"726.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">病人需使用呼吸器相關服務？</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-note\" x=\"574.7\" y=\"702.0\" width=\"374.3\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-note\" x=\"761.8\" y=\"726.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">應先依呼吸器依賴患者照護計畫規定事先報經保險人核准，</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-note\" x=\"761.8\" y=\"744.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">並登錄 VPN 呼吸照護系統</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"804.0\" width=\"685.0\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"828.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">收案後 2 週內（遇例假日得順延）由健保資訊網服務系統（VPN）送保險人備查</text></a><rect class=\"fl-box fl-end\" x=\"186.3\" y=\"888.0\" width=\"607.3\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"20.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-end\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"912.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">收案完成 保險人得視情況實地評估病人之醫療需求</text></svg>"
  },
  {
   "id": "hh-visit",
   "title": "居整計畫：訪視、照護與費用申報流程",
   "subtitle": "自開立醫囑至核付（依現行計畫第八、九、十點）",
   "plan": "hh",
   "legend": "點擊方框可跳至計畫全文對應條號。",
   "svg": "<svg class=\"flow-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 980 1018\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"居整計畫：訪視、照護與費用申報流程\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>居整計畫：訪視、照護與費用申報流程</title><defs><marker id=\"fl-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path class=\"fl-arrow\" d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\"/></marker><marker id=\"fl-arrow-fail\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path class=\"fl-arrow fl-arrow-f\" d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 64.0 L 451.2 101.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 148.0 L 451.2 170.0 L 490.0 170.0 L 490.0 185.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 250.0 L 490.0 287.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 352.0 L 490.0 389.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 436.0 L 490.0 458.0 L 257.0 458.0 L 257.0 473.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge fl-edge-fail\" d=\"M 483.0 500.0 L 567.7 509.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow-fail)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"528.8\" y=\"493.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 257.0 520.0 L 257.0 551.0 L 490.0 551.0 L 490.0 575.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"373.5\" y=\"546.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">否</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 622.0 L 490.0 644.0 L 451.2 644.0 L 451.2 659.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 724.0 L 451.2 761.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 826.0 L 451.2 863.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 910.0 L 451.2 932.0 L 490.0 932.0 L 490.0 947.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><rect class=\"fl-box fl-start\" x=\"264.0\" y=\"24.0\" width=\"374.3\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"20.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-start\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"48.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">已收案病人</text><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"9\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"108.0\" width=\"685.0\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"132.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">居家醫療主治醫師整體評估病人醫療需求，開立居家醫療照護醫囑</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"9\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"192.0\" width=\"762.7\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"216.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">視醫療需要於病歷註明照會理由，連結其他訪視人員：中醫師、護理人員、呼吸治療人員、藥師、其他專業人員（心理師或社會</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"234.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">工作人員）</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"294.0\" width=\"762.7\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"318.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">訪視：查驗健保卡〔含虛擬（行動）健保卡〕與身分證明文件，自備讀卡設備逐次登錄就醫紀錄，並於 24 小時內上傳保險人備</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"336.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">查</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"9\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"396.0\" width=\"762.7\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"420.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">每次訪視詳實製作病歷或紀錄，記錄自到達至離開案家之時間並請病人或家屬簽章；另製作居家醫療照護紀錄留存於案家</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><polygon class=\"fl-box fl-decision\" points=\"43.0,480.0 471.0,480.0 483.0,492.0 483.0,508.0 471.0,520.0 43.0,520.0 31.0,508.0 31.0,492.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"257.0\" y=\"504.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">收案期間病情轉變，需調整照護階段？</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-note\" x=\"574.7\" y=\"480.0\" width=\"374.3\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-note\" x=\"761.8\" y=\"504.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">無須結案後重新收案，但應於 1 週內（含例假日）於 VPN</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-note\" x=\"761.8\" y=\"522.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">登錄異動</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"8\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"582.0\" width=\"762.7\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"606.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">主治醫師於照護階段轉換或照護期滿應重新評估，且每 3 個月至少訪視 1 次，適時調整醫囑</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"666.0\" width=\"840.3\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"690.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">服務量上限（超過不予支付，緊急訪視不納入計算）：醫師與中醫師每日 8 人次、每月 180 人次（在宅專門醫師 240）；護理人員每月</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"708.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100 人次（僅安寧 45）；呼吸治療人員 60；藥師與其他專業人員 45</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"768.0\" width=\"840.3\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"792.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">按月申報：門診醫療／交付機構服務點數清單填報案件分類（居家醫療 E1、重度居家醫療 A1、安寧療護 A5、居家中醫 31、特約藥局 E）及</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"810.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">特定治療項目代號 EC；採同一療程每月申報一次</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"870.0\" width=\"840.3\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"894.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">部分負擔依全民健康保險法第 43 條居家照護規定計收；重大傷病、分娩、山地離島地區就醫免自行負擔；醫療資源缺乏地區得減免 20%</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-end\" x=\"186.3\" y=\"954.0\" width=\"607.3\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"20.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-end\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"978.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">保險人審查核付 採浮動點值，每點支付金額不高於 1 元</text></a></svg>"
  },
  {
   "id": "hh-urgent",
   "title": "居整計畫：緊急訪視加成判定",
   "subtitle": "依附件1 給付項目及支付標準通則九",
   "plan": "hh",
   "legend": "非屬適應症而於夜間或例假日之一般訪視，訪視費不得另計加成。",
   "svg": "<svg class=\"flow-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 980 856\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"居整計畫：緊急訪視加成判定\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><title>居整計畫：緊急訪視加成判定</title><defs><marker id=\"fl-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path class=\"fl-arrow\" d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\"/></marker><marker id=\"fl-arrow-fail\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path class=\"fl-arrow fl-arrow-f\" d=\"M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 64.0 L 451.2 86.0 L 334.7 86.0 L 334.7 101.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge fl-edge-fail\" d=\"M 638.3 146.0 L 723.0 137.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow-fail)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 334.7 184.0 L 334.7 221.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"340.7\" y=\"203.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是</text><path class=\"fl-edge fl-edge-fail\" d=\"M 638.3 248.0 L 723.0 266.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow-fail)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 334.7 268.0 L 334.7 308.0 L 451.2 308.0 L 451.2 341.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><text class=\"fl-label\" x=\"392.9\" y=\"303.0\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是</text><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 406.0 L 451.2 428.0 L 179.3 428.0 L 179.3 443.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 406.0 L 451.2 428.0 L 490.0 428.0 L 490.0 443.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 406.0 L 451.2 428.0 L 800.7 428.0 L 800.7 443.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 179.3 526.0 L 179.3 557.0 L 451.2 557.0 L 451.2 581.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 490.0 526.0 L 490.0 557.0 L 451.2 557.0 L 451.2 581.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 800.7 544.0 L 800.7 566.0 L 451.2 566.0 L 451.2 581.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 646.0 L 451.2 683.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><path class=\"fl-edge\" d=\"M 451.2 748.0 L 451.2 785.0\" marker-end=\"url(#fl-arrow)\"/><rect class=\"fl-box fl-start\" x=\"186.3\" y=\"24.0\" width=\"529.7\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"20.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-start\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"48.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">病人發生急性狀況，考慮緊急訪視</text><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><polygon class=\"fl-box fl-decision\" points=\"43.0,108.0 626.3,108.0 638.3,120.0 638.3,172.0 626.3,184.0 43.0,184.0 31.0,172.0 31.0,120.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"334.7\" y=\"132.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">是否符合 8 項適應症之一？生命徵象不穩定／呼吸喘急持續未改善／譫妄或意識狀態不穩定／急性</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"334.7\" y=\"150.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">疼痛發作／發燒或突發性體溫不穩定／急性腹瀉／須立即處理之管路問題／其他經醫師評估有立即</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"334.7\" y=\"168.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">前往需要者</text></a><rect class=\"fl-box fl-fail\" x=\"730.0\" y=\"108.0\" width=\"219.0\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"132.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">否</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"150.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">屬一般訪視，訪視費不得另計加成</text><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><polygon class=\"fl-box fl-decision\" points=\"43.0,228.0 626.3,228.0 638.3,240.0 638.3,256.0 626.3,268.0 43.0,268.0 31.0,256.0 31.0,240.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-decision\" x=\"334.7\" y=\"252.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">訪視人員別為醫師（不含中醫師）、護理人員或呼吸治療人員？</text></a><rect class=\"fl-box fl-fail\" x=\"730.0\" y=\"228.0\" width=\"219.0\" height=\"76.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"252.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">否</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"270.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">中醫師、藥師等不適用緊急訪視加</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-fail\" x=\"839.5\" y=\"288.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">成</text><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"348.0\" width=\"840.3\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"372.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">除已有長期醫囑之「須立即處理之管路問題」外，其他適應症須先由醫師就病情評估後決定適當醫事人員前往；緊急訪視相關醫囑應載於訪視</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"390.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">紀錄</text></a><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"450.0\" width=\"296.7\" height=\"76.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"179.3\" y=\"474.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">夜間</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"179.3\" y=\"492.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">下午 5 時至晚上 10 時</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"179.3\" y=\"510.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">加計 50%（支付成數 150）</text><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"341.7\" y=\"450.0\" width=\"296.7\" height=\"76.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"474.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">深夜</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"492.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">晚上 10 時至隔日早上 8 時</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"490.0\" y=\"510.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">加計 70%（支付成數 170）</text><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"652.3\" y=\"450.0\" width=\"296.7\" height=\"94.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"800.7\" y=\"474.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">例假日</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"800.7\" y=\"492.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">週六 0 時至週日 24 時、國定假日 0 時至</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"800.7\" y=\"510.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">24 時</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"800.7\" y=\"528.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">加計 40%（支付成數 140）</text><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-note\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"588.0\" width=\"840.3\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-note\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"612.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">同時符合夜間及例假日，加計 50%；同時符合深夜及例假日，加計 70%。以抵達案家時起算，若離開案家時跨不同加成區間逾 30 分鐘，則以</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-note\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"630.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">較高加成區間計算。</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-step\" x=\"31.0\" y=\"690.0\" width=\"840.3\" height=\"58.0\" rx=\"8.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"714.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">申報：「醫令執行時間－起／迄」填至時分（未依規定填報該筆醫令不予加成）、「支付成數」依加成數填報、「自費特材群組序號」填入</text><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-step\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"732.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">ECE；緊急訪視併居家照護每月申報一次</text></a><a class=\"fl-link\" href=\"#\" data-sec=\"10\" data-plan=\"hh\"><title>跳至該計畫條文</title><rect class=\"fl-box fl-end\" x=\"108.7\" y=\"792.0\" width=\"685.0\" height=\"40.0\" rx=\"20.0\"/><text class=\"fl-text fl-t-end\" x=\"451.2\" y=\"816.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">同一醫師對同一病人之緊急訪視每日以 1 人次為限，超過不予支付</text></a></svg>"
  },
